        "size_soon_note": "",
        "description_accordion_body": "Limited-edition Closed Sole for the Coperni Spring\u2013Summer 2026 Paris runway (Fashion Week 2026). Same patented 360\u00b0 grip and stability as core Closed Sole \u2014 heel and foot fully covered. Designed for Barre, Pilates, Reformer, Megaformer, Lagree, and Yoga.\n\nBoth Open and Closed perform the same grip and stability. Closed Sole: full coverage for a locked-in feel. Performance Skins replace traditional grip socks \u2014 no sliding, no bunching, no latex or silicone. Made in the USA.",
        "shipping_accordion": "Complimentary shipping on orders over $150. Orders ship within 1\u20132 business days. Standard delivery 3\u20135 business days; express 1\u20132 business days available at checkout.",
        "returns_accordion": "30-day returns on items in new, sellable condition. 90-day warranty covers manufacturing defects only."
      }
