      "settings": {
        "label": "The collaboration",
        "quote": "Open, gripping, and free from all constraints \u2014 while offering optimal comfort and performance.",
        "body_1": "Coperni \u00d7 Barreletics is a collaborative footwear line developed for the Coperni Spring\u2013Summer 2026 Ready-to-Wear Collection, blending high fashion with functional performance. The partnership introduced a Pilates shoe designed for comfort, grounding, and athletic poise \u2014 emphasizing stability and grip during movement.",
        "body_2": "These shoes were created to support the collection's overarching theme of merging biotechnology, wellness, and human-centered design \u2014 aligning with Coperni's focus on innovation and the body's natural rhythms.",
        "note_label": "On the runway",
        "note_text": "Footwear shifts too: the collection includes this Pilates shoe collaboration with Barreletics, designed for comfort, grounding, and athletic poise \u2014 a sense of balance, even on the runway.",
        "video_url": "",
        "video_caption": "Coperni 2026 Paris Fashion Week",
        "video_height_mobile": 72,
        "video_max_height_desktop": 720,
